          "snippet": {
            "text": "theorem logSqSum_le_half {W' W : ℝ} (hW : 2e6 ≤ W) (hW' : W / 2 ≤ W') :\n    logSqSum W' W ≤ 1 / 2 * W * Real.log W := by\n  refine le_trans ?_ (Prelim.sum_log_sq_primes_le hW)\n  refine sum_le_sum_of_subset_of_nonneg ?_ fun p _ _ => sq_nonneg _\n  exact filter_subset_filter _ (Ioc_subset_Ioc_left (Nat.floor_le_floor hW'))",
            "line": 35,
            "truncated": false
          },
          "proof_context": {
            "declaration": "TernaryGoldbach.MinorArcs.logSqSum_le_half",
            "lines": [
              35,
              39
            ],
            "conclusion": "logSqSum W' W <= (1/2) W log W for W >= 2e6 and W' >= W/2, which turns the first line into the factor (1/2) W log W."
